# compat=0 states (wrong core/arch) are FILTERED: with only incompatible states and no
# saves there is nothing to offer -> card skipped, launch proceeds.
desc launch card states: all compat=0 -> filtered out, no card
invoke wrap
config paired
wifi up
sdfile+ Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
engine 0|LOCAL=none
engine 0|LISTSTATE id=55 slot=1 compat=0 known=0 age=60 size=100 origin=lodor/knulli/gpsp/arm64 why="different architecture" name="foreign.state"\nRESULT mode=list-states n=1
expect_exit 0
expect_trace_absent PROMPT[
expect_trace_absent ENGINE --pull-state
expect_trace STOCK GBA rom=
expect_log card skipped (only Play
